    95	## 1. Profile identity
    96	
    97	- **Profile id:** `tessera-v1-strict`. It appears in the signed bytes as `common.profile` and in the DNS and git
    98	  record as `profile=`. [ENC §3.2:264; ENC §7:569; A9:142]
