  1462	### 15.1 Container [OWNER 2026-10-14, G14, G17, G33]
  1463	
  1464	A bundle is one UTF-8 JSON text that passes ENC §1.4 checks 1–5 and 7 and is canonical JCS. It contains no JSON
  1465	numbers. Heights and durations are decimal strings matching `0|[1-9][0-9]*` with value at most 4294967295. Binary
  1466	values are RFC 4648 §4 base64 with padding that round-trips (no non-zero pad bits, no line breaks). Size cap 2^27
  1467	bytes. Top level: exactly `{"layers":[L],"profile":"tessera-v1-strict"}`. After dispatch (section 3.1): a
  1468	non-canonical container is `INVALID / JSON_NONCANONICAL`; then the absence rule (section 2.1) and A9.5's
  1469	`git.object_format` outcomes; then any other schema failure is `INVALID / CONTAINER_SCHEMA`. Absence is inspected
  1470	only beneath correctly typed parents, a present non-string `object_format` is `CONTAINER_SCHEMA`, and a present
  1471	`issuer_record` with an absent internal field is `CONTAINER_SCHEMA` (section 2.1). [OWNER 2026-10-14, r2-F03]
  1472	
