  1474	D2/D3 read only `profile` and the length of `layers`) and rejected after dispatch by the container schema: a JSON
  1475	number anywhere in the layer is `INVALID / CONTAINER_SCHEMA` (row 2.4, after row 2.1), never `OUT_OF_PROFILE`.
