   182	What "never helpfully normalized" means here. The **issuer's ingestion** normalizes *spelling only*:
   183	- insignificant whitespace;
   184	- member order;
   185	- escape choice;
   186	- number spelling.
   187	
   188	It never changes a value. The **verifier normalizes nothing**: a payload must already equal `JCS` of its own
