   608	## 6. The DNSSEC-snapshot preimage
   609	
   610	```
   611	S = header("tessera-v1/dnssec-snapshot") ‖ u32 len(snapshot) ‖ snapshot        1 ≤ len ≤ 2^24
   612	```
   613	
   614	- The snapshot body's internal format belongs to the profile document (Track 3). P8 fixes only its envelope.
   615	- *Reason:* C4's snapshot rule gives the snapshot its own OTS proof. The tag keeps that proof from being
   616	  presented as a receipt anchor, or the reverse.
