    57	boundary-unambiguous; anything outside the domain is rejected, never normalized. A7 §A7.9 adds: the two
    58	signer-specific frames bind common attested content, and an encoding map places every binding in bytes (E§0). P7
    59	adds: no object of one type is accepted as another.
