   491	**Counts:** 71 golden vectors and 173 rejection vectors. On 2026-10-09 they were 66 and 126. The changes:
   492	- golden: SIG-01, SIG-02 and A-02 are added, and so are W-01 and W-02 (the window follow-up);
   493	- rejection: XA-09 to XA-32 and XR-09 to XR-17 are added, and so are XD-23 to XD-30 and XW-01 to XW-03 (the
   494	  window follow-up);
   495	- DNS-01 to DNS-03, XD-03, XD-05, XD-16 and XD-22 are regenerated for the window grammar;
   496	- for the 90-day single window (Amendment 9 disposition): XD-31 to XD-33 are added; DNS-01 to DNS-03, W-01, W-02,
   497	  XW-01 to XW-03 and the XD vectors built on the canonical value are regenerated; XD-30 (fractional seconds) no
   498	  longer fits one character-string and is now `DNS_STRINGS`;
